  "headCont": "생물구성다양성",
  "contentval": "000NIzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/1444",
  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에 중1 2단원 생물 다양성 도입부로 아이들과 활동한&#160;</p><p>수업 내용과 학습지를 공유드립니다</p><p>&#160;</p><p>본 게시물의 제목인 &#39;우리 강산 푸르게 푸르게&#39;는</p><p>1984년부터 유한 킴벌리에서 진행한</p><p>공익 캠페인인데요.</p><p>최근 ai를 이용하여 관련 광고를 만들어</p><p>많은 관심을 받고 있는 중입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>활동내용은 이 광고들을 보고 생물 다양성에 대해 생각해보고 답변해볼 수 있도록 구성했습니다.</p><p>학습지를 만든 이후에도 계속 광고들이 나오고 있어서&#160;</p><p>먼저 끝난 학생들은 더 알고 싶은 내용들을 찾아보고</p><p>또 영상을 보며 활동지가 아니라도 서로 이야기를 나누는 시간들을 가졌는데요</p><p>혹 선생님들께서 수업하실 때는 더 영상들을 찾아보고 얘기나누셔도 좋을 것 같습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래는 활동지에 링크로 들어가 있는 영상들만 올려드렸습니다.</p><p>귀여운 수업, 그리고 또 재밋지만 진지한 수업 되셨으면 좋겠습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mn2xAt_wBW8&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=14&amp;pp=iAQB\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mn2xAt_wBW8&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=14&amp;pp=iAQB</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mn2xAt_wBW8&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=14\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"854\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/c80qu2/dJMb81gdJVE/8BmdIk8UUdblgkzEIbpkp1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AZsjr/dJMb81gdJVF/lfkHx8GXUMKpW7MjoKPGnk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"854\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mn2xAt_wBW8\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_q4Aa4k-LlE&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=13&amp;pp=iAQB\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_q4Aa4k-LlE&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=13&amp;pp=iAQB</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_q4Aa4k-LlE&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=13\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"854\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/oJ8bt/dJMb83SEhoR/wQW2ggzleJZjuKvXYaBFAK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cI93oh/dJMb85XevpJ/CJt1hbBqG75oF8BKZoog1k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"854\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_q4Aa4k-LlE\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftEDm-qo-Hg&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=10&amp;pp=iAQB\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftEDm-qo-Hg&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=10&amp;pp=iAQB</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftEDm-qo-Hg&amp;list=PLu4Uj5-WJwhuK7IwEePq_vQr_UpDNCK5e&amp;index=10\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"854\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/rVf84/dJMb9iI1yXk/UAVOacnbdhKPxo0qEjpTT1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/RTdiR/dJMb9efyUGT/SXsLzzLgcFGEwMOMNuWi91/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"854\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"